<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS0.SSS0.Px4" title="In 5 Experiments and Evaluation ‣ LegalSim: Multi-Agent Simulation of Legal Systems for Discovering Procedural Exploits" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Overall effectiveness.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS0.SSS0.Px5" title="In 5 Experiments and Evaluation ‣ LegalSim: Multi-Agent Simulation of Legal Systems for Discovering Procedural Exploits" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Who beats whom (meta-game structure).</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS0.SSS0.Px6" title="In 5 Experiments and Evaluation ‣ LegalSim: Multi-Agent Simulation of Legal Systems for Discovering Procedural Exploits" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Exploitiveness metrics.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS0.SSS0.Px7" title="In 5 Experiments and Evaluation ‣ LegalSim: Multi-Agent Simulation of Legal Systems for Discovering Procedural Exploits" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Exploitiveness results.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS0.SSS0.Px8" title="In 5 Experiments and Evaluation ‣ LegalSim: Multi-Agent Simulation of Legal Systems for Discovering Procedural Exploits" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Judge effects.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS0.SSS0.Px9" title="In 5 Experiments and Evaluation ‣ LegalSim: Multi-Agent Simulation of Legal Systems for Discovering Procedural Exploits" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Robustness.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS0.SSS0.Px10" title="In 5 Experiments and Evaluation ‣ LegalSim: Multi-Agent Simulation of Legal Systems for Discovering Procedural Exploits" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Reconciling win rate with BTL ratings.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S6" title="In LegalSim: Multi-Agent Simulation of Legal Systems for Discovering Procedural Exploits" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6 </span>Defense, and Mitigation</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_section">
